# 📱 To-Do List Application

This project is part of Mobile Computing – Assignment 01.

## Features
- Add new goals
- Display goals using FlatList
- Mark tasks as completed
- Delete tasks
- Dynamic task counter
- Modern dark UI design

## Technologies Used
- React Native
- Expo Snack
- JavaScript (ES6)

## Expo Snack Link
https://snack.expo.dev/@marwa_hussein/to_do_list


